+class _SynchronizedFiniteIterator:
+    """Synchronize EOF per microbatch without retaining an accumulation group.
+
+    Every rank fetches at most one local batch, then WORLD-reduces a one-bit
+    availability flag. If any rank is exhausted, unmatched local batches are
+    discarded and all ranks stop before entering the next model collective.
